---
description: UI/UX principles for all frontend work
globs: ["**/*.tsx", "**/*.css"]
alwaysApply: false
---

- Feels like a calm, premium research lab, not a generic AI chat app.
- Spacious layout, strong typographic hierarchy, ONE accent color, dark + light mode.
- Every screen: one clear primary action and a helpful empty state.
- Skeletons and progress states for anything async. Never a blank screen.
- Fully responsive, keyboard accessible, WCAG AA contrast.
- Use shadcn/ui components and design tokens. No ad-hoc colors or magic spacing values.
- Microcopy: plain, confident, human.
